"><img src="/os/settings.svg" alt="" draggable="false" width="64" height="64"><span class="dock-name" aria-hidden="true">设置</span></button><button type="button" class="app decoy" data-action="decoy" data-decoy="calendar" title="日历" aria-label="日历"><img src="/os/calendar.svg" alt="" draggable="false" width="64" height="64"><span class="dock-name" aria-hidden="true">日历</span></button></div><button type="button" class="kpill" data-action="kuro-call" aria-label="Kuro"><img src="/kuro/k3d_base.png" alt=""><span class="ln">Whatever happens, I&#39;ve got you.</span><span class="on">在线</span><span class="turns">今天 0/5</span></button></div></div><button type="button" class="other-tab" data-side="right" data-action="screen" data-screen="right"><span class="tab-app docs">工作台<b>5</b></span></button></div>"`;

exports[`desktop snapshots (requirements §3) > day 13 ring room: 右屏 工作台 + Kuro 1`] = `"<div class="stage one-monitor" data-day="13" data-beat="work" data-focus="right" data-fx="pores" style="--fx-pores:0.5"><div class="screen-toggle"><button type="button" class="" data-action="screen" data-screen="left">左屏</button><button type="button" class="on" data-action="screen" data-screen="right">右屏</button></div><div class="monitor" data-side="right" data-ring="room" data-app="workbench"><div class="os"><div class="top"><span class="brand">新世界</span><span>工作台</span><div class="day"><span>第 13 天 · 上午 10:00</span><span>☂ 雨停了</span><span class="kuro-dot" title="在线"></span><span>Kuro</span><button type="button" class="sys-off" data-action="desktop-shutdown" disabled>关机</button></div></div><div class="win wb" style="left:24px;top:54px;width:1392px;height:760px"><div class="bar"><div class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="title">工作台</span><span style="margin-left:auto">自动保存</span></div><div class="body"><nav class="wb-rail"><button type="button" class="ri" data-action="wb-nav" data-page="msgs"><i class="rg msgs" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>消息</span><span class="n">10</span></button><button type="button" class="ri on" data-action="wb-nav" data-page="home"><i class="rg home" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>工作台</span></button><button type="button" class="ri" data-action="wb-nav" data-page="docs"><i class="rg docs" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>文档</span></button><div class="ri"><i class="rg approvals" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>审批</span></div><div class="ri"><i class="rg contacts" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>通讯录</span></div></nav><div class="side"><div class="logo"><i></i><div><b>未来智能 · 工作台</b><small>未来智能 · 你写的</small></div></div><div class="search">找活、找人、找文件…</div><button type="button" class="it on" data-action="wb-nav" data-page="home">工作台</button><div class="it">新任务</div><button type="button" class="it" data-action="wb-nav" data-page="docs">文档</button><button type="button" class="it" data-action="wb-nav" data-page="code">代码</button><button type="button" class="it" data-action="wb-nav" data-page="ledger">账本</button><div class="it">工单</div><div class="it">项目</div><div class="sec">在办的事</div><div class="sec">最近</div><div class="me"><i></i><div><b>你</b><br><small style="color:var(--ink-3)">合伙人 · 研发</small></div></div></div><div class="main"><div class="hello"><img src="/kuro/k3d_base.png" alt=""><div><h1>早上好。</h1><p>三件事在办。接着昨天的，或者扔一句新的。它算出来的结果都会存进记录。</p></div></div><div class="ask"><input class="ph" data-input="wb-draft" data-enter="wb-send" readonly value="" placeholder="说一句，比如：把 v16 和 v17 合一版" aria-label="说一句，比如：把 v16 和 v17 合一版"><div class="strip"><button type="button" class="scope" data-action="wb-scope" aria-pressed="false">只看本公司文档</button><button type="button" class="go" data-action="wb-send" disabled>↑</button></div></div><div class="cards"><div class="card"><div class="h"><i></i>在办<small>全部 ↗</small></div></div><div class="card"><div class="h"><i></i>文档<small>全部 ↗</small></div></div><div class="card"><div class="h"><i></i>账本<small>打开 ↗</small></div><div class="big">43<small></small></div></div><div class="card now"><div class="h"><i></i>此刻<small>此时此刻的「你」· 克总整理</small></div><div class="ln"><span>让它做而没看一眼</span><span>次</span></div></div><div class="card"><div class="h"><i></i>更新日志</div><div class="ln"><span style="flex:1;border-top:1px solid var(--ink-2);margin-top:10px"></span></div></div></div><div class="sect"><h3>常做的事<small>点一个，直接开始</small></h3><div class="tabs"></div><div class="qa"></div></div><div class="sect"><h3>接着昨天的</h3><div class="chips"></div></div></div></div></div><button type="button" class="kpill" data-action="kuro-call" aria-label="Kuro"><img src="/kuro/k3d_base.png" alt=""><span class="ln">I noticed some old things on your desk. Let me give them a hand.</span><span class="on">在线</span><span class="turns">今天 0/5</span></button></div></div><button type="button" class="other-tab" data-side="left" data-action="screen" data-screen="left"><span class="tab-app msgs">消息<b>4</b></span><span class="tab-app docs">工作台<b>10</b></span><span class="tab-app feed">浏览器</span></button></div>"`;

